    - Term: UI/66-46rWs66ekIOyVhOydtO2FnOydgCDqtazrp6TtlZjqsbDrgpgg67KX6ri0IOuSpCDsoIDsnqXtlbQg7KO87IS47JqULg
      TermType: 0
      Description: "\uBBF8\uAD6C\uB9E4 \uC544\uC774\uD15C\uC740 \uAD6C\uB9E4\uD558\uAC70\uB098
        \uBC97\uAE34 \uB4A4 \uC800\uC7A5\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
      Languages:
      - "\uBBF8\uAD6C\uB9E4 \uC544\uC774\uD15C\uC740 \uAD6C\uB9E4\uD558\uAC70\uB098
        \uBC97\uAE34 \uB4A4 \uC800\uC7A5\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
      - Buy or remove unowned items before saving.
      - "\u672A\u8CFC\u5165\u306E\u670D\u306F\u8CFC\u5165\u3059\u308B\u304B\u5916\u3057\u3066\u304B\u3089\u4FDD\u5B58\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
      - "\u8BF7\u8D2D\u4E70\u6216\u5378\u4E0B\u672A\u8D2D\u4E70\u7684\u670D\u88C5\u540E\u518D\u4FDD\u5B58\u3002"
      - "Kaufe oder entferne nicht gekaufte Gegenst\xE4nde vor dem Speichern."
      - "Achetez ou retirez les objets non poss\xE9d\xE9s avant d\u2019enregistrer."
      - Compra o quita los objetos que no tienes antes de guardar.
      - "Compre o elimine art\xEDculos que no sean de su propiedad antes de guardarlos."
      - Compre ou remova artigos sem propriedade antes de guardar.
      - Acquista o rimuovi oggetti senza proprietario prima di salvare.
      - Koop of verwijder items die je niet bezit voordat je ze opslaat.
      - "K\xF8b eller fjern uejede varer, f\xF8r du gemmer."
      - "Kj\xF8p eller fjern ueide varer f\xF8r du lagrer."
      - "K\xF6p eller ta bort o\xE4gda f\xF6rem\xE5l innan du sparar."
      - Osta tai poista omistamattomat tuotteet ennen tallentamista.
      - "Kup lub usu\u0144 niepotrzebne elementy przed zapisaniem."
      - "P\u0159ed ulo\u017Een\xEDm si kupte nebo odstra\u0148te polo\u017Eky, kter\xE9
        nevlastn\xEDte."
      - "Pred ulo\u017Een\xEDm si k\xFApte alebo odstr\xE1\u0148te polo\u017Eky,
        ktor\xE9 nevlastn\xEDte."
      - "Ment\xE9s el\u0151tt v\xE1s\xE1roljon vagy t\xE1vol\xEDtson el nem birtokolt
        elemeket."
      - "Cump\u0103ra\u021Bi sau elimina\u021Bi articolele nede\u021Binute \xEEnainte
        de a salva."
