      Description: "\uC1A1\uC2E0 \uB300\uAE30\uC5F4\uC774 \uAC00\uB4DD \uCC3C\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      Languages:
      - "\uC1A1\uC2E0 \uB300\uAE30\uC5F4\uC774 \uAC00\uB4DD \uCC3C\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      - The send queue is full.
      - "\u9001\u4FE1\u5F85\u3061\u306E\u30C7\u30FC\u30BF\u304C\u4E0A\u9650\u306B\u9054\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
      - "\u53D1\u9001\u961F\u5217\u5DF2\u6EE1\u3002"
      - Die Sendewarteschlange ist voll.
      - "La file d\u2019envoi est pleine."
      - "La cola de env\xEDo est\xE1 llena."
      - "La cola de env\xEDo est\xE1 llena."
      - "A fila de envio est\xE1 cheia."
      - "La coda di invio \xE8 piena."
      - De verzendwachtrij is vol.
      - "Sendek\xF8en er fuld."
      - "Sendek\xF8en er full."
      - "S\xE4ndningsk\xF6n \xE4r full."
      - "L\xE4hetysjono on t\xE4ynn\xE4."
      - "Kolejka wysy\u0142ania jest pe\u0142na."
      - "Fronta odes\xEDl\xE1n\xED je pln\xE1."
      - "Front na odosielanie je pln\xFD."
      - "A k\xFCld\xE9si sor megtelt."
      - "Coada de trimitere este plin\u0103."
