      - "C\u0103n ph\xF2ng \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA7y. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 tham
        gia v\u1EDBi t\u01B0 c\xE1ch kh\xE1n gi\u1EA3."
