      Languages:
      - "{0}\uB2D8\uC744 \uAC15\uD1F4\uD560\uAE4C\uC694?"
      - Kick {0} from the room?
      - "{0}\u3092\u9000\u51FA\u3055\u305B\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F"
      - "\u8981\u5C06{0}\u79FB\u51FA\u623F\u95F4\u5417\uFF1F"
      - '{0} aus dem Raum entfernen?'
      - Exclure {0} du salon ?
      - "\xBFExpulsar a {0} de la sala?"
      - "\xBFEchar a {0} de la habitaci\xF3n?"
      - Expulsar {0} da sala?
      - Cacciare {0} dalla stanza?
      - '{0} uit de kamer schoppen?'
      - Sparke {0} fra rummet?
      - Sparke {0} fra rommet?
      - "Sparka {0} fr\xE5n rummet?"
      - potkaistako {0} huoneesta?
      - "Wyrzuci\u0107 {0} z pokoju?"
      - "Vyhodit u\u017Eivatele {0} z m\xEDstnosti?"
      - "Vyhodi\u0165 pou\u017E\xEDvate\u013Ea {0} z miestnosti?"
      - "Kir\xFAgni {0} szem\xE9lyt a szob\xE1b\xF3l?"
      - "\xCEl dai pe {0} din camer\u0103?"
      - "\u0412\u044B\u0433\u043D\u0430\u0442\u044C {0} \u0438\u0437 \u043A\u043E\u043C\u043D\u0430\u0442\u044B?"
      - "\u0412\u0438\u0433\u043D\u0430\u0442\u0438 {0} \u0437 \u043A\u0456\u043C\u043D\u0430\u0442\u0438?"
      - "{0} odadan at\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131?"
      - "\u0647\u0644 \u062A\u0631\u064A\u062F \u0637\u0631\u062F {0} \u0645\u0646
        \u0627\u0644\u063A\u0631\u0641\u0629\u061F"
