      - "\u7528\u53EF\u7231\u4E1D\u5E26\u73AF\u7ED5\u89D2\u8272\u3002"
      - "Umrahme deinen Charakter mit h\xFCbschen Schleifen."
      - Entourez votre personnage de jolis rubans.
      - Rodea tu personaje con bonitos lazos.
      - Rodea a tu personaje con preciosas cintas.
      - Rodeie a sua personagem com lindas fitas.
      - Circonda il tuo personaggio con adorabili nastri.
      - Omring je personage met mooie linten.
      - "Omgiv din karakter med dejlige b\xE5nd."
      - "Omring karakteren din med nydelige b\xE5nd."
      - "Omge din karakt\xE4r med vackra band."
      - "Ymp\xE4r\xF6i hahmosi upeilla nauhoilla."
      - "Otocz swoj\u0105 posta\u0107 pi\u0119knymi wst\u0105\u017Ckami."
      - "Obklopte svou postavu kr\xE1sn\xFDmi stuhami."
      - "Obklopte svoju postavu kr\xE1snymi stuhami."
      - "Vedd k\xF6r\xFCl karakteredet sz\xE9p szalagokkal."
      - "\xCEnconjoar\u0103 personajul t\u0103u cu panglici minunate."
      - "\u041E\u043A\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0435\u0433\u043E
        \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043E\u043D\u0430\u0436\u0430 \u043A\u0440\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0432\u044B\u043C\u0438
        \u043B\u0435\u043D\u0442\u0430\u043C\u0438."
      - "\u041E\u0442\u043E\u0447\u0456\u0442\u044C \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0433\u043E
        \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043E\u043D\u0430\u0436\u0430 \u0447\u0443\u0434\u043E\u0432\u0438\u043C\u0438
