      - "Omring karakteren din med sm\xE5 konstellasjoner."
      - "Omge din karakt\xE4r med sm\xE5 konstellationer."
      - "Ymp\xE4r\xF6i hahmosi pienill\xE4 t\xE4htikuvioilla."
      - "Otocz swoj\u0105 posta\u0107 ma\u0142ymi konstelacjami."
      - "Obklopte svou postavu drobn\xFDmi souhv\u011Bzd\xEDmi."
      - "Obklopte svoju postavu drobn\xFDmi s\xFAhvezdiami."
      - "Vedd k\xF6r\xFCl karakteredet apr\xF3 csillagk\xE9pekkel."
      - "\xCEnconjoar\u0103-\u021Bi personajul cu constela\u021Bii minuscule."
      - "\u041E\u043A\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0435\u0433\u043E
        \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043E\u043D\u0430\u0436\u0430 \u043A\u0440\u043E\u0448\u0435\u0447\u043D\u044B\u043C\u0438
