      - "Avec le Pass peintre, recevez des gemmes chaque jour sans publicit\xE9 :
        {0}."
      - "Con el Pase de pintor, recibe gemas cada d\xEDa sin ver un anuncio: {0}."
      - 'Con Painter Pass, reclama gemas diariamente sin publicidad: {0}.'
      - "Com o Painter Pass, resgate joias diariamente sem an\xFAncios: {0}."
      - "Con Painter Pass, richiedi le gemme ogni giorno senza pubblicit\xE0: {0}."
      - 'Met Painter Pass kun je dagelijks edelstenen claimen zonder advertentie:
        {0}.'
      - "Med Painter Pass kan du f\xE5 \xE6delstene dagligt uden en annonce: {0}."
      - "Med Painter Pass kan du gj\xF8re krav p\xE5 edelstener daglig uten en annonse:
