      - "Identiteten til l\xF8gneren og spionen"
      - "L\xF6gnarens och spionens identitet"
      - "Valehtelijan ja vakoojan henkil\xF6llisyydet"
      - "To\u017Csamo\u015B\u0107 k\u0142amcy i szpiega"
      - "Identita lh\xE1\u0159e a \u0161pi\xF3na"
      - "Identita klam\xE1ra a \u0161pi\xF3na"
      - "A hazug \xE9s a k\xE9m kil\xE9te"
      - "Identitatea mincinosului \u0219i a spionului"
      - "\u041B\u0438\u0447\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u043B\u0436\u0435\u0446\u0430
        \u0438 \u0448\u043F\u0438\u043E\u043D\u0430"
      - "\u041E\u0441\u043E\u0431\u0438 \u0431\u0440\u0435\u0445\u0443\u043D\u0430
